  "body": "On some platforms when the user dismisses an app's notification without activating it, the app is never woken up to be told that. No client-side app code is run in this case; the app is only woken up upon activation of the notification.\r\n\r\nCould the wording of [§2.8 Closing a notification](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#closing-a-notification) be loosened to allow for such cases?",
